## @file
#  Publishes EDKII_PCI_HOST_MEMORY_POLICY_PROTOCOL, identifying VirtIO-GPU
#  hostmem prefetchable BARs so the generic PCI bus driver leaves them
#  without a firmware-assigned UC cache attribute.
